		<section id="plans" class="third_section premum_section" >
    <div class="custom_container">
        <div class="premum_benifits">
            <h2 class="plan_head header_grad">What is Care Plus Health Insurance Plan?</h2>
            <p>Introduced by Care Health Insurance, Care Plus is a complete health insurance plan designed for individuals with no upper age limit. Investing in health insurance in your 30s or early 40s is the most indispensable investment that you must not ignore. It helps people to avoid hefty hospital bills and stay fit during the most crucial years of their life. Thus, considering rising inflation and health safety in mind, it is wise to opt for this policy as early as possible. The policy offers comprehensive inflation-proof coverage with no co-payment clause. It also reduces your extra medical expenses with OPD cover and comes with unlimited recharge, even for related illnesses.</p>

<p>Furthermore, its new-age benefits like unlimited e-consultation with General Physicians, an Earn &amp; Burn Reward program, and a health portal to take care of your healthcare needs.</p>

<p>Care Health Insurance brings Care Plus- The Complete Health insurance Plan.</p>

<h2>Plan Highlights of Care Plus Health Insurance Plan</h2>

<ul>
	<li>Available on an individual and family floater basis.</li>
	<li>Wide range of sum insured ranges from Rs 3 lakhs to Rs 25 lakhs.</li>
	<li>10% Renewal Discount is available after 40 years of age. It is available for customers entering at age&lt;36 years.</li>
	<li><a href="https://www.careinsurance.com/health-insurance/no-claim-bonus">No claim bonus</a> protect for every claim-free year. 50% increase in SI per for every claim-free year; maximum up to 200% SI.</li>
</ul>

<p>Furthermore, its new-age benefits like unlimited e-consultation with General Physicians, an Earn &amp; Burn Reward program, and a health portal to take care of your healthcare needs.</p>

<p>Care Health Insurance brings Care Plus- The Complete Health insurance Plan.</p>

<h2>Plan Highlights of Care Plus Health Insurance Plan</h2>

<ul>
	<li>Available on an individual and family floater basis.</li>
	<li>Wide range of sum insured ranges from Rs 3 lakhs to Rs 25 lakhs.</li>
	<li>10% Renewal Discount is available after 40 years of age. It is available for customers entering at age&lt;36 years.</li>
	<li><a href="https://www.careinsurance.com/health-insurance/no-claim-bonus">No claim bonus</a> protect for every claim-free year. 50% increase in SI per for every claim-free year; maximum up to 200% SI.</li>
</ul>
