<div class="reduction_in_ped popup_one simple_text_popup">
    <div class="modal-content">
        <div class="modal-inner-content">
            <span class="close1 comon_close_btn">&times;</span>
            <p class="header_grad">Reduction in PED Wait Period</p>
            <div class="cover_cont">
                <p>
                Choosing this optional cover reduces the applicable wait period of 36 months for Claims related to Pre-existing diseases, to 24 months. The claims will be admissible for any medical expenses incurred for hospitalization in respect of diagnosis/treatment of any pre-existing disease after completion of 24 months of continuous coverage under the policy.
                </p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>
<div class="no_claim_bonus popup_one simple_text_popup">
    <div class="modal-content">
        <div class="modal-inner-content">
            <p class="header_grad">No Claim Bonus Super</p>
            <span class="close1 comon_close_btn">&times;</span>
            <div class="image_cont">
                <img alt="No Claim Bonus Super" title="No Claim Bonus Super" width="100%" height="100%" class="lozad"
                    data-src="https://www.careinsurance.com/images/addon/NCB_Banner.png"></img>
            </div>
            <div class="cover_cont">
                <p>For 5 consecutive claim free years by using No Claims Bonus (NCB) & No Claims Bonus – Super (Optional
                    Cover).Incremental increase every year is applicable on base Sum Insured. If a claim is made in any
                    particular year, accrued NCB and NCB-Super will be reduced at the same rate at which it is accrued.
                </p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>
<div class="OPD-care popup_one simple_text_popup">
    <div class="modal-content">
        <div class="modal-inner-content">
            <p class="header_grad">OPD Care</p>
            <span class="close1 comon_close_btn">&times;</span>
            <div class="cover_cont">
                <p>Through this optional cover, one can claim amount equivalent to their bills provided at the time of
                    reimbursement. Coverage amount ranging from INR 5,000 to INR 50,000 can be opted.</p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>


<div class="covid_care popup_one simple_text_popup">
    <div class="modal-content">
        <div class="modal-inner-content">
            <span class="close1 comon_close_btn">&times;</span>
            <p class="header_grad">Benefits of Covid Care</p>
            <div class="cover_cont">
                <ol class="t_left">
                    <li><strong>In-patient Care:</strong> If You are admitted to a hospital for in-patient care due to
                        Illness related to Coronavirus disease which should be Medically Necessary, for a minimum period
                        of 24 consecutive hours</li>
                    <li><strong>Day Care Treatment:</strong> we will indemnify you for Medical Expenses incurred on Day
                        Care Treatment maximum up to the Sum Insured, provided that period of treatment for you in the
                        Hospital/Day Care Centre does not exceed 24 hours.</li>
                    <li><strong>Sub-limits on Coverage for Quarantine:</strong> we will indemnify you for Medical
                        Expenses incurred maximum up to 1% S.I. per day maximum up to 30 days in a Policy</li>
                    <li><strong>Pre-Hospitalization Medical Expenses:</strong> Under Pre-hospitalization Medical
                        Expenses, for a period of 30 days immediately prior to your date of admission to the Hospital
                    </li>
                    <li><strong>Post-Hospitalization Medical Expenses:</strong> Under Post-hospitalization Medical
                        Expenses, for a period of 60 days immediately after your date of discharge from the Hospital.
                    </li>
                </ol>
                <p>For more details on exclusions & policy terms kindly refer to product <a
                        href="https://cms.careinsurance.com/cms/public/uploads/download_center/covid-care--(health-insurance-product)-policy-t&c-(effective-from-01-april-2021).pdf?rv=0.34712600%201620903874"
                        target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">T & C</a></p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>

<div class="care_shield popup_one simple_text_popup">
    <div class="modal-content">
        <div class="modal-inner-content">
            <p class="header_grad">Care Shield</p>
            <span class="close1 comon_close_btn">&times;</span>
            <div class="cover_cont">
                <p><b>The policy has 3 benefits :</b></p>
                <p>
                <ol>
                    <li style="text-align: left; padding: 2px;"><b> Claim Shield-</b> List of Non-payable expenses like
                        attendant charges, gloves, mask etc, now payable under this benefit in the policy (For detailed
                        list refer Annexure I of policy details)</li>
                    <li style="text-align: left; padding: 2px;"><b> No Claim bonus Shield-</b> If total payable claim
                        amount in Policy Year is <25% Sum Insured, then No Claim Bonus (No Claim Bonus Super, if opted)
                            as applicable in base product shall not be reduced.</li>
                    <li style="text-align: left; padding: 2px;"><b> Inflation Shield-</b> The base policy Sum Insured
                        will be increased on cumulative basis at each renewal on the basis of inflation rate in previous
                        year</li>
                </ol>
                </p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>		

