		<!-- FAQ SECTION -->
		
		<section id="faqs" class="faq_sec">
   <div class="custom_container">
      <div class="faq_heading">
         <h2 class="ins_heading">FAQs On Care Plus - Complete Health Plan</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="responsive_con">
         <div class="faq_contant">
            <section class="faq_acc">
<h3>Q. What is the Care Plus- The Complete Health insurance Plan?</h3>

<div>
<p>It is an indemnity-based health insurance plan for individuals aged 36 or above with no upper age limit.</p>
</div>
</section>

<section class="faq_acc">
<h3>Q. What is the minimum age limit for the Care Plus - The Complete Health insurance Plan?</h3>

<div>
<p>You can include your children as young as 91 days up to 24 years on a family floater basis under the Care Plus health plan. The age of the proposer should be 18 years.</p>
</div>
</section>

<section class="faq_acc">
<h3>Q. What is the Maximum Entry Age under Care Plus - The Complete Health insurance Plan?</h3>

<div>
<p>This health insurance plan is available with no upper age limit.</p>
</div>
</section>

<section class="faq_acc">
<h3>Q. How many cashless healthcare providers have the company tied up for Care Plus - The Complete Health insurance Plan?</h3>

<div>
<p>For this plan, we have tied up with 20,800+ cashless healthcare providers across India.</p>
</div>
</section>

<section class="faq_acc">
<h3>Q. What are the benefits of the Care Plus - The Complete Health insurance Plan?</h3>

<div>
<p>It offers various benefits such as in-patient hospitalisation, pre and post-hospitalisation, daycare treatments, AYUSH cover, cashless hospitalisation, and more, with a special 5% discount if you opt for it online.</p>
</div>
</section>

<section class="faq_acc">
<h3>Q. Do I need to undergo medical tests to buy this policy?</h3>

<div>
<p>No pre-policy medical checkup is required to buy this policy. However, we may ask the insured person to undergo tele-underwriting, which may include specific tests.</p>
</div>
</section>

<section class="faq_acc">
<h3>Q. Is there any tax exemption under Care Plus - The Complete Health insurance Plan?</h3>

<div>
<p>Under section 80D of the Income Tax Act of India 1961, the premium paid for this policy gets tax exemption.</p>
</div>
</section>

<section class="faq_acc">
<h3>Q. Do I need a separate health insurance plan, even if I have a Care Plus - The Complete Health insurance Plan?</h3>

<div>
<p>It is a comprehensive health insurance plan for individuals and their families. However, you can consider our Care Senior if you have ageing parents. On the other hand, if you have any past medical history of diabetes, hypertension, or High BMI, opt for our Care Freedom.</p>
</div>
</section>

<section class="faq_acc">
<h3>Q. Do I need Care Plus - The Complete Health insurance Plan if everyone is healthy in my family?</h3>

<div>
<p>Health emergencies can hit anytime, irrespective of age. Also, most health insurance plans have a long waiting period, especially for pre-existing diseases; that&#39;s why it is wise to get this plan as early as possible to avail of its benefits timely.</p>
</div>
</section>

<section class="faq_acc">
<h3>Q. Does Care Plus - The Complete Health insurance Plan allow cashless benefits?</h3>

<div>
<p>Yes, you can avail of a hassle-free cashless hospitalisation facility at our network hospitals across the country.</p>
</div>
</section>
         </div>
      </div>
   </div>
</section>
            		

		 
